# The printer call (tests/programs/storage.asm): a line printed on each
# printer, and the arguments refused. MAME's AT has no slot for a printer
# card (docs/emulators.md).
program: storage
define: STORAGE_PRINTERS
emulators: bochs dosbox-x
lpt1: printed on LPT1
lpt2: printed on LPT2
---
rx286, test build
print: LPT1 took 16 bytes
print: LPT2 took 16 bytes
print: nothing: 0 bytes
print: printer 2: error 3
print: too much: error 3
print: across the data's limit: error 1
